5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to see if the ground is tricky. I'll check regional firms tendering for earth-moving and depot phasing notes on hoarding the site.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,I'm thinking about the bills. I'll look into the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the terms of the regional habitat fund.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I would like to see how things have aged. I'll check the record of the eastern avenue planting and condition of works from the earlier programme.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am worried about the staff. I will examine the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services and volunteer groups working with the division.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll focus on how the park is actually used. I'll check timed counts of weekday crossings and drainage callouts and August heat readings.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
